==Description==
'''Creepy Santa Charm''' is an exclusive charm introduced in [[The Final Act Event#The Final Act Battle Pass|The Final Act Battle Pass]] as a reward for reaching Level 24 on the premium track. It had a cost of {{PlushieSnowman|775}} or {{Robux|108}} ({{Robux|86}} during the Christmas 2025 Sale), with a total cost of {{PlushieSnowman|8,575}} or {{Robux|2,115}} ({{Robux|1,682}} during the Christmas 2025 Sale).

==Appearance==
'''Creepy Santa Charm''' has the {{Color|FinalAct|Creepy Santa}} [[Necromancer]] skin standing on a stage with with two lights on it. Next to the {{Color|FinalAct|Creepy Santa}} [[Necromancer]], there is a giant snowman. It plays the default charm placement sound.

The color of the '''Creepy Santa Charm''' depends on the color of the player's name in chat, but it is red in its preview in the inventory.

